# A1/02_numbers.letz

@lesson A1.02 "Numbers 1-20"

@word eent = one
@word zwee = two
@word dräi = three
@word véier = four
@word fënnef = five
@word sechs = six
@word siwen = seven
@word aacht = eight
@word néng = nine
@word zéng = ten
@word eelef = eleven
@word zwielef = twelve
@word dräizéng = thirteen
@word véierzéng = fourteen
@word fofzéng = fifteen
@word siechzéng = sixteen
@word siwwenzéng = seventeen
@word uechtzéng = eighteen
@word nonzéng = nineteen
@word zwanzeg = twenty

@sentence
@lu Ech sinn zwanzeg Joer al.
@en I am twenty years old.
@distractor-en ten
@distractor-en thirty
@distractor-lu zéng
@distractor-lu dräizéng

@sentence
@lu Dat sinn dräi Kanner.
@en Those are three children.
@distractor-en two
@distractor-en five
@distractor-lu zwee
@distractor-lu fënnef

@sentence
@lu Ech hunn fënnef Bicher.
@en I have five books.
@distractor-en six
@distractor-en four
@distractor-lu sechs
@distractor-lu véier
